<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories by Size</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap" style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;">
    <table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody><tr><td><strong>Single</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.39</td><td>400 cal</td><td>18g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Double</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$7.99</td><td>560 cal</td><td>30g</td></tr></tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>The DQ Original Cheeseburger — Reliable Simplicity</h2>
  <p>The Original Cheeseburger proves a straightforward truth: a well-made burger does not need complexity. A quality beef patty, American cheese, the right ratio of ketchup to mustard, crisp pickles, and sharp onion on a toasted bun — nothing missing, nothing extraneous. It is the most affordable burger on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> and also the most versatile.</p>
  <h2>Why the Original Cheeseburger Is the Best Value</h2>
  <p>At $6.39 (400 cal), the Original Cheeseburger is the cheapest entry point into DQ's burger lineup. But the real value unlocks when you combine it with the <strong>$7 Meal Deal</strong>:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Original Cheeseburger (alone): $6.39</li>
    <li><strong>$7 Meal Deal</strong> (Cheeseburger + Fries + Drink + Small Sundae): $7.00</li>
    <li><strong>Savings vs. ordering items individually: approximately $7.78</strong></li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you are ordering a cheeseburger, always check whether the $7 Meal Deal is available at your location before ordering à la carte.</p>
  <h2>Original Cheeseburger vs. DQ Stackburgers</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Burger</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Best For</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>Original Cheeseburger</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.39</td><td>400</td><td>Best value, everyday order, $7 Meal Deal</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Double Cheeseburger</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$7.99</td><td>560</td><td>Hungrier guests wanting more protein</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Backyard Bacon Ranch Stackburger</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$9.99</td><td>730</td><td>Premium flavors, bacon fans</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>FlameThrower® Stackburger</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$10.87</td><td>780</td><td>Bold, spicy, full Stackburger experience</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>The Original Cheeseburger — What's On It</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>100% real seasoned beef patty</strong> — Never frozen, cooked to order</li>
    <li><strong>American cheese</strong> — One slice, melted on the patty</li>
    <li><strong>Ketchup</strong> — Balanced amount, not excessive</li>
    <li><strong>Yellow mustard</strong> — Adds the classic burger tang</li>
    <li><strong>Dill pickles</strong> — Crisp, briny contrast</li>
    <li><strong>Chopped onion</strong> — Sharp, fresh bite</li>
    <li><strong>Toasted bun</strong> — Holds up to all the toppings</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the DQ Original Cheeseburger?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">$6.39 (single, 400 cal). The Double is $7.99 (560 cal).</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is on the DQ Original Cheeseburger?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Beef patty, American cheese, ketchup, mustard, dill pickles, and chopped onion on a toasted bun.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the Original Cheeseburger in the $7 Meal Deal?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. The Original Cheeseburger is one of two entree options in the $7 Meal Deal, which adds Regular Fries, a Soft Drink, and a Small Sundae for $7.00 total.</div></div></div></div>
  <p style="margin-top:32px;">For the complete DQ menu including all categories and deals, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.</p>
</div></section>

